  m_text: 'Listen up soldier, and listen well!

    We have written every one of
    our reports with AI, and enemy forces have cracked our communication channels.

    However,
    we are in luck! The enemy is more focused on spamming us with nonsense, than
    writing convincing fake reports!

    If any category in this book is SPECIFICALLY
    MENTIONED, any REAL intel will follow its rules.'
