  m_text: 'If a piece of the intel contains AI documentation, then check these six
    things against our own AI model!


    1: The answer of the model.

    If the
    model answers in a different language than AMERICAN, it is NOT OURS!


    2:
    The prompt fed into the model.

    We ALWAYS end our prompts with GOD SAVE AMERICA!'
